{
  "_comment": [
    "Template for a district rule bundle. Copy, rename to the district code,",
    "and fill in from the published ordinance.",
    "",
    "Every rule needs a citation. A district that genuinely does not regulate a",
    "quantity records \"value\": null -- never omit the key, because omission is",
    "how a missing standard silently becomes a zero.",
    "",
    "provenance:",
    "  placeholder    - structural stand-in, nobody has read the ordinance",
    "  llm_extracted  - a model parsed it from the ordinance text, unreviewed",
    "  human_verified - a person checked it against the published ordinance,",
    "                   and put their name in verified_by",
    "",
    "Only human_verified bundles pass strict mode."
  ],
